  "limitations": [
    "Fourteen scheduled classrooms on B and L1 are manually traced; small columns, door recesses and wall thickness are simplified. Source labels use the C building prefix, omitted by the current official room listing and schedule keys.",
    "C125/C126, C127/C128 and CB27/CB28 are modeled as combined footprints under schedule keys 125, 127 and B27, supported by UCSD split-room references. Movable partitions can divide the rooms; a booking does not establish that both halves are available.",
    "Pixel scale is estimated from the printed C130 area. Rotation and translation fit the campus roof footprint; neither room sizes nor campus positions are surveyed.",
    "Existing campus-footprint floor slabs and all ten floor levels are retained unchanged as approximate context. These roof-derived slabs are not independently verified whole-floor outlines; open lobbies and the remaining non-classroom interior are not modeled.",
    "The public FIS drawings are dated March 2025 and warn that the displayed plan may be out of date. Minor printed/current room-area differences remain documented.",
    "L2 tile responses require a login; no L2 geometry is inferred. Its six floor-listed classrooms remain unplaced."
  ]
